From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:43:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D201 server: relative session directories are rejected with
 400

Upstream: POST /api/session and POST /api/experimental/session/import with a relative location.directory, and
GET /api/session?directory=relative, answer 500 with an empty body. AbsolutePath is an unchecked brand, so the
path reaches the database column, which throws "Path is not absolute".
Fixed: they answer 400 InvalidRequestError (field location.directory or directory, message "<field> must be an
absolute path", the shape /api/debug/heap-dump already uses for a relative directory).
Scenarios: session-api-crud.test.ts "create a session with invalid payloads", "list sessions with invalid
queries"; session-api-transfer.test.ts "import without a location and as a child" (new request)
Upstream tests: packages/server/test/session-create.test.ts adds a test

